    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nContracts are ready to issue so you could be moved in very quickly!\n\nNumber 17 is set to the back of The Grove, just off Clonard Road, so it has little or no road noise. With its west facing rear garden, off-street parking and solar panels for hot water, this home offers more than most.\nOn the ground floor is the living room to the front with solid fuel stove, and direct access to the dining area. To the back is a modern kitchen/dining area with French door access to the rear garden. The kitchen has been very well designed to make the most of the space and the west facing rear garden is low maintenance but really packs a punch. On the first floor are two double bedrooms and main bathroom.\nOriginally built as a 2 bedroom home, the attic space is accessible by a staircase and is currently presented as a bedroom with an en-suite. \nBuilt 1985, west facing rear garden, mains services, OFCH with solar panels for hot water. A little gem in a very accessible estate, with easy access to everything Wexford has to offer."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nPorch - 1.4m x 0.6m\nwith sliding door and tiled flooring\n\nEntrance Hall - 3.3m x 1.75m\nwith tiled floor and understair storage. Same tile runs through to the kitchen\n\nLiving Room - 4.7m x 2.9m\nwith laminate flooring and solid fuel stove. Built in storage to one side of the fireplace\n\nKitchen/Dining Area - 4.8m x 3.2m\nwith tiled flooring, waist and eye level units with island unit (0.9m deep - perfect for a breakfast bar), gas hob, built in eye-level oven and microwave, French doors to rear garden\n\nLanding - 3.6m x 0.8m\nwith carpet on landing and stairs\n\nBathroom - 2.5m x 1.7m\nfully tiled with WC, WHB and mains shower over the bath, heated towel rail\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.6m x 2.9m\nrear facing room with laminate flooring, great built-in storage (1.9m x 0.6m with shelving and hanging area)\n\nHot Press - 0.9m x 0.9m\n\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.3m x 2.9m\nfront-facing room, laminate flooring, storage area (1.9m x 0.6m with shelving and hanging area)\n\nLanding - 1.7m x 0.8m\nwith window on landing area\n\nLanding - 1.7m x 1.5m\nwith carpet flooring and shelved area\n\nUpper Room - 3.6m x 3m\nwith timber flooring and built-in storage, two skylights and revealed brick wall\n\nEn-Suite - 2.4m x 1.6m\nwith timber flooring, WC, WHB, electric shower in tiled surround\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>96 sqm (including upper floor)</li><li>Semi-detached with off-street parking</li><li>Living room with stove</li><li>Kitchen/dining with access to the rear garden</li><li>2 bedrooms and bathroom on first floor</li><li>Upper floor presented with en-suite bedroom</li><li>West facing low-maintenance garden to the rear</li><li>Mains services, solar panels for hot water, OFCH</ul>"
      },
